WEBVTT
NOTE SYNC_TYPE: HUMAN_VERIFIED
NOTE Track: 1-04 - The Unspoken Word
NOTE Artist: The Paper Wall
NOTE Album: 2001: Static and Silence (Book 1)

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:18.000
[Instrumental Intro: Searching Flute Melody]

00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:24.500
I see the mask come down again

00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:30.200
A stranger where my friend has been

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:35.200
I feel the static start to rise

00:00:35.355 --> 00:00:40.500
Behind the emptiness in your eyes

00:00:40.600 --> 00:00:45.243
You're building walls of steel and stone

00:00:47.675 --> 00:00:53.000
And I'm so scared you're all alone

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:57.500
I'm reaching out, a silent plea

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:03.500
Oh brother, please, come back to me

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:11.800
This is the unspoken word, the space between the lines

00:01:11.900 --> 00:01:16.800
A desperate signal, a secret sign

00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:21.614
More than a feeling, more than a touch

00:01:21.694 --> 00:01:25.800
It's knowing that I miss you much

00:01:25.900 --> 00:01:30.500
You're not alone, I'm not alone

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:36.445
On this dark path you've been thrown

00:01:43.973 --> 00:01:47.355
He's standing there, a ghost in white

00:01:49.936 --> 00:01:55.500
Stealing all your precious light

00:01:55.600 --> 00:02:01.200
I see the future, dark and gray

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:06.800
As he prepares to take you away

00:02:06.900 --> 00:02:12.308
I'm playing our song, a desperate prayer

00:02:12.368 --> 00:02:18.500
To let you know that I am still there

00:02:18.600 --> 00:02:23.800
The only way that I know how

00:02:23.900 --> 00:02:29.702
To save you from this broken vow

00:02:29.722 --> 00:02:36.800
This is the unspoken word, the space between the lines

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:41.596
A desperate signal, a secret sign

00:02:41.616 --> 00:02:47.440
More than a feeling, more than a touch

00:02:47.460 --> 00:02:52.200
It's knowing that I miss you much

00:02:52.300 --> 00:02:57.800
You're not alone, I'm not alone

00:02:57.900 --> 00:03:05.291
On this dark path you've been thrown

00:03:05.500 --> 00:04:08.000
[Flute Solo: Luna's Final Unheard Warning]
